{"c":[{"name":"20261007T020955Z-5dafeedfea56fda2","text":"W1: canned evals never pick a plausible wrong candidate; run helper/scripts/guard-adversary.ts (offline, ~2 s) each batch: class (a) writes must stay 0. A labelled multi-value line offers its parts, not its whole (line-values severalValues).","type":"note"},{"name":"20261007T025421Z-86d442b2d62eead8","text":"Any path that writes a chosen value into a field checks fill/writable.ts writeMisfit (fill, planner validate, codeplan, offer filter, goal gate); add new value rules there, not beside one caller. Candidates are only added, never swapped out.","type":"note"}]}
